# COSMOQ Contact Page Extraction

**URL**: `https://cosmoq.framer.website/contact`

---

## Page Structure

```
├── Navigation
├── Hero Section
├── Contact Options (3 cards)
├── Support Form Section
├── Offices Section (Global Presence)
├── FAQ Section
├── Footer CTA
└── Footer
```

---

## Section 1: Hero

### Content
- **H1**: "Need Smarter AI Solutions?"
- **Description**: "Connect any app or system pre-built or custom with ease and flexibility."

---

## Section 2: Contact Options

### Card 1: Expert Team
- **H3**: "Connect with Expert Team"
- **Description**: "Get personalized guidance and see how Cosmoq AI Agents can transform your enterprise workflows. Our experts will help you explore solutions"
- **CTA**: "Get Help" → `mailto:support@cosmoq.com`

### Card 2: Press & Media
- **H3**: "Press & Media Inquiries"
- **Description**: "For interviews, articles, and media requests."
- **CTA**: "Write to us" → `mailto:support@cosmoq.com`

### Card 3: Partners
- **H3**: "Partner & Collaboration"
- **Description**: "Explore collaboration and integration opportunities."
- **CTA**: "Let's Connect" → `mailto:support@cosmoq.com`

---

## Section 3: Support Form

### Content
- **Label**: "SUPPORT"
- **H2**: "We're Here to Help"
- **Description**: "Have questions or need assistance? Reach out to our support team via the form, phone, or email."

### Contact Info
- **Label**: "GET SUPPORT"
- **Phone**: +1 844 924 8973
- **Email**: support@cosmoq.com

### Form Fields
| Field | Type | Required |
|-------|------|----------|
| First Name | text | Yes |
| Last Name | text | Yes |
| Email | email | Yes |
| Contact Number | tel | Yes |
| Query | textarea | Yes |

- **Submit Button**: "Submit"

---

## Section 4: Offices

### Content
- **Label**: "OFFICES"
- **H2**: "Our Global Presence"
- **Description**: "Our strategic offices across key regions enable us to serve our clients."

