## Form CSS

```css
.contact-form {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 16px;
}

.form-input {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  border: 1px solid rgba(125, 164, 255, 0.16);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 16px;
  color: #fff;
  font-family: "Inter";
}

.form-input:focus {
  border-color: #0175ff;
  outline: none;
}

.form-textarea {
  min-height: 120px;
  resize: vertical;
}
```

### Map Component
- Interactive map with pins for each office
- Click to expand office details
